aching load: 2 + 0 in the first two years for Assistant Professors; 3 + 0 thereafter. Subsidized, university-allocated housing (up to 9 years, subject to eligibility). Faculty publish regularly in AMJ, AMR, JAP, OBHDP, Org Science, PNAS, and othertop outlets. Singapore is a stable, safe, cosmopolitan city-state where English is an officiallanguage and the quality of life rivals that of major North American and European cities. Responsibilities Produce high-impact scholarly research. Teach in our Undergraduate, MSc, MBA, EMBA, PhD, and Executive Educationprograms. Supervise doctoral students and contribute to a vibrant research culture in a diverseand inclusive community. Required Qualifications A PhD in Management, OB, HRM, I/O Psychology, or a closely related discipline. A strong track record of publishing in top-tier journals. Commitment to excellent, innovative teaching. Application Procedure To ensure full consideration, please submit a cover letter, curriculum vitae, and brief statements of research and teaching interests to Jen Lee at mno-recruitment@nus.edu.sg, using the subject line “OB/HR Position,”. The search committee will be scheduling meeting times during the Academy of Management Annual Meeting. If you are interested in being considered for a meeting, please contact the Chair of the Search Committee, Hemant Kakkar, at hemant_kakkar@nus.edu.sg. Req ID: 33745 Apply now Legal Branding guidelines Contact us Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © National University of Singapore. All Rights Reserved."
